    "detailed_description": "In this VR Puzzle game, you take on an epic Journey by moving around a little Fellow. Meet the Giant Clock tower and three other small little friends on the way! Collect Ordinary, but therefore Special Engravings as you move on.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n1.  \tLight up the lantern to make the world shift into a whole new place.<br />\r\n2.  \tThe world will change into a wholly new place within the Range that you choose.<br />\r\n3.  \tCombine, Use special Abilities the Figures grant you with.<br />\r\n4.  \tSurvey the Area carefully.<br />\r\n5.  \tLook for hidden Background Stories!<br />\r\n6.  \tCute friends are always willing to aid you.<br />\r\n7.  \tThe Rest will be released real soon :)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Last friend of the three will be accompanying your journey Shorty. Please wait up and look forward to the game!",
